{"path":"chrono/year/ok","title":"std::chrono::year::ok","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::year::</span>ok","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/year/ok","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Checks if the year value stored in *this is in the valid range, i.e., [-32767, 32767].","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> ok<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Checks if the year value stored in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is in the valid range, i.e., <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">32767</span></span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">32767</span></span></code><code>]</code></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code> if the year value stored in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code> is in the range <span><code>[</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">-</span><span class=\"nu0\">32767</span></span></code><code>,&nbsp;</code><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"nu0\">32767</span></span></code><code>]</code></span>. Otherwise <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">false</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Possible_implementation\">Possible implementation</h3>\n<p>See the implementations in\n<a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/gcc-mirror/gcc/blob/919858077f4b768c8472f29b977edf0aa6e0f1e5/libstdc%2B%2B-v3/include/std/chrono#L1606\" data-external=\"1\">libstdc++</a>,\n<a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/llvm-mirror/libcxx/blob/78d6a7767ed57b50122a161b91f59f19c9bd0d19/include/chrono#L1832\" data-external=\"1\">libc++</a>,\nand Howard Hinnant's\n<a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://github.com/HowardHinnant/date/blob/0b72599bd43f72d8935e507e25e4f0063f9bb34e/include/date/date.h#L1630\" data-external=\"1\">date.h</a>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"eq-fun-cpp-table\">\n<tr>\n<td>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> Year\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">short</span> year_<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>   <span class=\"co1\">// exposition-only</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">public</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">bool</span> ok<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> year_ <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/types/numeric_limits\"><span class=\"kw351\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numeric_limits</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">short</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">min</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*...*/</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iomanip&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"input year │ internal value │ ok()<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/boolalpha\"><span class=\"kw1781\">std::<span class=\"me2\">boolalpha</span></span></a><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">2020</span>, <span class=\"nu12\">0x8000</span>, <span class=\"nu12\">0x8001</span>, <span class=\"nu12\">0xFFFF</span>, <span class=\"nu12\">0x18000</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year\"><span class=\"kw2636\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">year</span></span></a> y<span class=\"br0\">{</span>i<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" │ \"</span>\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/manip/setw\"><span class=\"kw1814\">std::<span class=\"me2\">setw</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">14</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>y<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" │ \"</span>\n                  <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> y.<span class=\"me1\">ok</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>input year │ internal value │ ok()\n      2020 │           2020 │ true\n     32768 │         -32768 │ false\n     32769 │         -32767 │ true\n     65535 │             -1 │ true\n     98304 │         -32768 │ false</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Possible implementation","id":"Possible_implementation"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/year","title":"std::chrono::year"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::year::ok","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++20. Checks if the year value stored in *this is in the valid range, i.e., [-32767, 32767]."},{"label":"Return value","note":"true if the year value stored in *this is in the range [-32767, 32767]. Otherwise false."},{"label":"Possible implementation","note":"See the implementations in libstdc++, libc++, and Howard Hinnant's date.h."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":["C++20"],"wordCount":165,"codeBlockCount"